# Follow this path (global plan, e.g. from a planner that knows the map): rbl_controller's goal is its
# last pose, and the path is followed as given -- no local replanning -- with rbl's reactive collision
# avoidance on top. A later plain ~/goto (rbl_msgs/Vec4) switches back to the local replanner.
nav_msgs/Path path
---
bool success
string message
